{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>יוֹם הַכִּפֻּרִים הוּא מִקְרָא קֹדֶשׁ וגו׳.</b> Meaning: without the intermediate act of proclaiming it holy, and without the affliction that they practice on it, it is a day of atonement of itself. And from this it follows that there is reward for the commandment of proclaiming it holy and for affliction on it, beyond the benefit of atonement."], :book :leviticus, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T20:00:30.875607433Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}